msgid ""
"A stage allows you to present a live stream to your audience, optionally "
"combined with chat and Q&A features."
msgstr ""
"Un escenario le permite presentar una transmisión en vivo a su audiencia, con"
" chat y preguntas y respuestas opcionales."

msgid ""
"A video channel allows you to connect with attendees in real time and host "
"workshops or panels. The video channels are powered by BigBlueButton and "
"support 25-80 people, depending on usage."
msgstr ""
"Un canal de video le permite conectar con los asistentes en tiempo real y "
"realizar talleres o paneles. Los canales de video funcionan con BigBlueButton"
" y admiten de 25 a 80 personas, según el uso."

msgid ""
"A video channel allows you to connect with attendees in real time and host "
